ess&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bfc4bf954ae2d427d89bf3fbcaaaa24 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私の友人があなたを推薦してくれたの！\n\n私のOCの腰から上のアートを描いてくれませんか？これが彼女の参考資料です！https://i.imgur.com/9DS9Vdf.png\n\nこれが私が欲しいポーズの棒人間です！: https://i.imgur.com/gdwQxNR.png\n\n 片方の腕を曲げて見せ、もう片方の腕は腰に当てている。\n\n表情は、見る人を見据えて、牙を見せるような自信に満ちた微笑みを浮かべてはどうだろうか。\n\n服装は、シンプルな白のタンクトップに黒の体操着がいい。\n\nありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@grape_gumgum/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/30b27b64/uploads/origins/b791b177-1d4b-48c9-a78c-5743158f64af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab2e7e40cebb5814b388581ef868c05f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/30b27b64/uploads/origins/b791b177-1d4b-48c9-a78c-5743158f64af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab2e7e40cebb5814b388581ef868c05f, https://si.imgix.net/30b27b64/uploads/origins/b791b177-1d4b-48c9-a78c-5743158f64af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b6967c6f5edcbc05b803ed3b6f1094c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/30b27b64/uploads/origins/b791b177-1d4b-48c9-a78c-5743158f64af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f5647f613c1723370b6b0e8077e9aeb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I really love your artstyle! I would love to see you draw my character. I would like if it could be scary or horror themed! You are welcome to choose his outfit!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Vc7JVQX-R1jSi84ALjBqD2ieHBdiUkWI?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@grape_gumgum/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6c1e745a/uploads/origins/84c2e3b6-fdee-4bd8-9ffd-858cd9f9e065?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f19331703ca357e3ff48996c35492c55", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6c1e745a/uploads/origins/84c2e3b6-fdee-4bd8-9ffd-858cd9f9e065?bg=%23fff